{
  "name": "blast-charge-loading-ui",
  "description": "Visual verification of charge loading UI: per-hole charges, explosive types, amounts, charge-all, visual indicators",
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "new_game seed:42",
      "timeout": 30,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "new_game seed:42"
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 50000,
          "holeCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan grid rows:3 cols:3 spacing:5 depth:6 start:15,15",
      "description": "Two increment clicks on the spacing stepper (data-field=\"spacing\") raise it 3->5m (DEFAULT_SPACING_M, Drill.ts) before dragging, so the (15,15)-(25,25) rectangle computes the declared 3x3 instead of the default-spacing 4x4 (issue #479 follow-up, Finding #4).",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"blast\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"grid-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"spacing\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"spacing\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "dragTiles",
          "x1": 15,
          "z1": 15,
          "x2": 25,
          "z2": 25
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "holeCount": 9
        },
        "note": "3 rows x 3 cols = 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:H1 explosive:boomite amount:3 stemming:2",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H1\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "3 kg"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "2.0 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H1\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Per-hole charging is a real control now (gap G3, ChargeHoleList.ts): the Charge step renders a \"Per Hole\" section, one row per hole keyed by data-hole, each with its own commit button at [data-hole=\"<id>\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]. That button dispatches `charge hole:<id> explosive:<selected> amount:<amount>kg stemming:<stemming>m` from the panel's current product card / amount / stemming values (ChargeStep.chargeHole, Charge.ts) — the same three values Charge All reads, so the steppers have to be driven to the declared numbers first. 2 amount decrements (5 -> 3kg) reach this hole's declared 3kg; stemming is already at the 2.0m default and boomite is already the selected product, so neither needs a click. Amount steps by 1kg (data-field=\"amount\", clamped to the selected product's [minChargeKg, maxChargeKg]); stemming steps by 0.2m with a 0.5m floor (data-field=\"stemming\", Charge.ts adjustStemming). Both are plain instance fields on ChargeStep with no reset path, so they carry over from the previous charge step in the same page session — asserted before each commit rather than assumed.",
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:H2 explosive:boomite amount:8 stemming:2",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "8 kg"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "2.0 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H2\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "5 amount increments (3 -> 8kg) off what the H1 row left behind. 8kg is exactly boomite's maxChargeKg, so this is the largest charge the amount stepper will hand a boomite hole — one more click is a no-op, not an overshoot.",
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:H3 explosive:boomite amount:5 stemming:1",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "5 kg"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "1.0 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H3\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "3 amount decrements (8 -> 5kg) and 5 stemming decrements (2.0 -> 1.0m) — the first step in this file to move stemming off its default.",
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:* explosive:boomite amount:5 stemming:2",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "5 kg"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "2.0 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"charge-all\"]"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 9
        },
        "note": "Charge All applies uniformly to every hole, overwriting the 3 individual per-hole charges set above — the H5 override below then re-charges just that one hole again after this"
      },
      "description": "Charge All commits whatever the steppers currently show, and the H3 row above left them at 5kg/1.0m — so reaching this step's declared 5kg/2m needs 5 stemming increments (1.0 -> 2.0m) before the click. Without them the click would silently charge every hole at 1.0m stemming while the command field claimed 2m: exactly the class of drift the amount/stemming asserts are here to fail loudly on."
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:H5 explosive:boomite amount:7 stemming:3",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-step=\"2\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "7 kg"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "3.0 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H5\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "A single hole re-charged after Charge All, which is the whole point of the per-hole rows. The explicit [data-step=\"2\"] click is required: Charge All completed the plan, so the still-armed autoAdvance had already moved the panel on to Sequence and the Per Hole rows were hidden. 2 amount increments (5 -> 7kg) and 5 stemming increments (2.0 -> 3.0m) then reach the declared values.",
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 9
        },
        "note": "count is unchanged — H5 was already charged by Charge All; what this step proves is that one row can override one hole without disturbing the other 8"
      }
    }
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "overview",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 45
    },
    {
      "name": "closeup",
      "yaw": 90,
      "pitch": 10
    },
    {
      "name": "birdseye",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 80
    }
  ]
}
